ack (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 78) (register "x8"))) (property (id "amoor-d-old") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOOR.D reads the old -5 into rd, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 81) (register "x5"))) (property (id "amoor-d-new") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOOR.D of -5 and 7 leaves 0xffffffffffffffff in memory, read back (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 83) (register "x8"))) (property (id "amomin-d-old") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOMIN.D reads the old -5 into rd, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 86) (register "x5"))) (property (id "amomin-d-new") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOMIN.D of -5 and 7 leaves 0xfffffffffffffffb in memory, read back (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 88) (register "x8"))) (property (id "amomax-d-old") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOMAX.D reads the old -5 into rd, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 91) (register "x5"))) (property (id "amomax-d-new") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOMAX.D of -5 and 7 leaves 0x7 in memory, read back (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 93) (register "x8"))) (property (id "amominu-d-old") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOMINU.D reads the old -5 into rd, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 96) (register "x5"))) (property (id "amominu-d-new") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOMINU.D of -5 and 7 leaves 0x7 in memory, read back (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 98) (register "x8"))) (property (id "amomaxu-d-old") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOMAXU.D reads the old -5 into rd, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 101) (register "x5"))) (property (id "amomaxu-d-new") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOMAXU.D of -5 and 7 leaves 0xfffffffffffffffb in memory, read back (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 103) (register "x8"))) (property (id "word-amo-keeps-upper") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "A word AMO writes only the addressed word: the upper word stays set, read back in x11 (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 108) (register "x11"))) (property (id "word-amo-ignores-rs2-upper") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "A word AMO ignores rs2's upper word: read as 64 bits it is below -5, and AMOMIN.W would store its low word, 7; -5 stays, read back (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 115) (register "x8"))) (property (id "rd-equals-rs2-old") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "With rd equal to rs2 the old -5 reaches rd (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 118) (register "x12"))) (property (id "rd-equals-rs2-sum") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "And memory took -5 + 7: rs2 was read before rd was written, 2 in x13 (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 119) (register "x13"))) (property (id "rd-equals-rs1-old") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "With rd equal to rs1 the old -5 reaches rd (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 122) (register "x14"))) (property (id "rd-equals-rs1-sum") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "And the address was read before rd was written: -5 + 7 at the old address, read back through x1 (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 123) (register "x3"))) (property (id "amoadd-aq-decodes") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOADD.W with the acquire bit decodes and reads the old -5: the annotation orders nothing this one hart can observe (RVI-A §12.1.1; RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 126) (register "x5"))) (property (id "amoadd-rl-decodes") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOADD.W with the release bit decodes and reads the old -5: the annotation orders nothing this one hart can observe (RVI-A §12.1.1; RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 129) (register "x5"))) (property (id "amoadd-aqrl-decodes") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "AMOADD.W with both bits decodes and reads the old -5: the annotation orders nothing this one hart can observe (RVI-A §12.1.1; RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 132) (register "x5"))) (property (id "lr-aqrl-decodes") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "LR.W with both bits decodes and reads -5 (RVI-A §12.1.1; RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 135) (register "x14"))) (property (id "sc-aq-decodes") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "SC.W with the acquire bit decodes and pairs with that LR.W: 0 in rd (RVI-A §12.1.1; RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 137) (register "x15"))) (property (id "lr-w-sign-extends") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "LR.W loads the word, sign-extended, into x14 (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 140) (register "x14"))) (property (id "sc-w-succeeds") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "With the reservation held, SC.W writes 0 to rd, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 142) (register "x15"))) (property (id "sc-w-stored") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "And the store happened: 7 in x16 (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 144) (register "x16"))) (property (id "second-sc-fails") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "An SC invalidates this hart's reservation either way, so a second SC fails: 1, the failure code the declared policy names, in rd (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 146) (register "x15"))) (property (id "failed-sc-stores-nothing") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "And a failed SC writes nothing to memory: 7 still, in x17, where it would have stored -5 (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 148) (register "x17"))) (property (id "lr-d-reads") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "LR.D loads the doubleword into x18 (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 151) (register "x18"))) (property (id "sc-d-succeeds") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "With the reservation held, SC.D writes 0 to rd, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 153) (register "x19"))) (property (id "sc-d-stored") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "And the store happened: 7 in x20 (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 155) (register "x20"))) (property (id "amo-fault-cause") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "An AMO at 2^40 raises the store/AMO access fault, cause 7, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.4; RVP-MACHINE §2.1.1.15).") (gpr_witness (step_n 165) (register "x30"))) (property (id "amo-fault-keeps-rd") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "The faulting AMO did not complete: rd keeps 41, copied to x25 (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 170) (register "x25"))) (property (id "lr-fault-cause") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "An LR at 2^40 raises the load access fault, cause 5, replacing a sentinel (RVI-A §12.1.2; RVP-MACHINE §2.1.1.15).") (gpr_witness (step_n 177) (register "x30"))) (property (id "lr-fault-keeps-rd") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "The faulting LR did not complete: rd keeps 41, copied to x25 (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 182) (register "x25"))) (property (id "lr-fault-reserves-nothing") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "And the faulting LR registered nothing: this SC writes the failure code, 1 (RVI-A §12.1.2).") (gpr_witness (step_n 184) (register "x15"))) (property (id "amo-unreadable-cause") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "An AMO on an unreadable page raises the store/AMO page fault, 15, never the load page fault, 13: one store-rules translation (RVP-SUPERVISOR §11.1.4.1; RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 238) (register "x22"))) (property (id "amo-unreadable-stval") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "And stval holds the virtual address it faulted on (RVP-SUPERVISOR §11.1.1.9).") (gpr_witness (step_n 239) (register "x23"))) (property (id "translated-amo-reads") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "A translated AMO on a readable, writable page completes: the old -5 in rd (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 243) (register "x5"))) (property (id "translated-amo-writes") (requirement_id "REQ-GC-ATOMICS") (obligation_ids "OB-GC-ATOMICS") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "And memory took the sum: 2, read back through the same page (RVI-A §12.1.4).") (gpr_witness (step_n 245) (register "x8"))) (input (id "guest-source") (role "guest-source") (path "profiles/rv64gc-lab-v0/guests/atomics-forms.s") (sha256 "cdbf6b06f1396c6f8dad37bc07c34d8bd00c715b5dad30d98c73c5e34bba978f")) (input (id "collector") (role "collector") (path "scripts/matched_gpr_unit_collector.py") (sha256 "cf685e721cb24ca8e71c74e2288564320b239581ff66089dff29e5a9d1293d36")) (input (id "adapter") (role "adapter") (path "scripts/run_rv64gc_sail.py") (sha256 "3547137e18db9ad9d9c95770d0fd985f2ed9ec2864a21b7259829dd2a102b411")) (input (id "guest-image") (role "guest-image") (path "evidence/rv64gc-atomics-v1/guest.elf") (sha256 "a152841108b6b539ce542abd2093aa78107c5a0f350f18b46bfe62bd7a7fc588")) (input (id "reference-config") (role "reference-config") (path "evidence/rv64gc-atomics-v1/reference-config.json") (sha256 "666d937305f503aa2754784186945f033ade43601f9c9d0073a9ffeefeb43ed2")) (input (id "expectation") (role "expectation") (path "evidence/rv64gc-atomics-v1/baseline.expected.sexp") (sha256 "b8e9448e06ac1570cd878d8c48256a0803ae80f7846a623c0831b8b3c5428c73")) (input (id "mutant-expectation") (role "expectation") (path "evidence/rv64gc-atomics-v1/control.expected.sexp